+When you change the selected session or color scheme on the login screen, or log in, the greeter writes:
 
 | Key in `sync.toml` | Purpose |
 |--------------------|---------|
 | `[session].last` | Last Wayland session selected, using its desktop-entry `Name=` |
+| `[user].last` | Last user that logged in successfully; selected on startup when still in the user list |
 | `[appearance].scheme` | Last color scheme selected, unless `greeter.toml` pins one |
 
